  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "A sharp, urgent knock resonates on my outer door, carrying a hint of timid hesitation, as if the person behind it were slightly apprehensive and ready to flee at any moment.",
      "output_sha256": "2bbb078207b748153cfe5e0c0b7cb7a3f33e0ec6a481bc39705691db6a454fa5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": 0.358652,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        1
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "03ef44cbac29aca82d5a7be3823174d2ea9199d9d81ea756a5b125ee56ea7dc5"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_ai_sha256": "2bbb078207b748153cfe5e0c0b7cb7a3f33e0ec6a481bc39705691db6a454fa5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I roll over and regard the clock.",
      "output_sha256": "656a2b00c520fa8d4beb3b05f22f1f53208bab84fe47302a589c9a31e27a5351",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_human_sha256": "656a2b00c520fa8d4beb3b05f22f1f53208bab84fe47302a589c9a31e27a5351",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Four-forty.",
      "output_sha256": "ac19c5652b87bdd04ae28ef48e7775bc688c537761cf08736decab98cca831f0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_human_sha256": "ac19c5652b87bdd04ae28ef48e7775bc688c537761cf08736decab98cca831f0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "One of the odd side effects of my long tenure as a senior assistant at sea is the tendency to awaken around four in the morning.",
      "output_sha256": "355bf54d288ed9bc3fecaf26c005067253c6fe8ab55fd2893efafeaa2cb9d54d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": 0.450993,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        4
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "577ae0d643d7f9ad1a8df4d43675ee756d28a28fc5a69a51502697d5d466b40d"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_ai_sha256": "355bf54d288ed9bc3fecaf26c005067253c6fe8ab55fd2893efafeaa2cb9d54d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        4,
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "This gives me several hours, while on land, to reflect on my shortcomings, weaknesses, and, less frequently, my achievements and strengths.",
      "output_sha256": "5ec57acb1f6f2d8e2ab71b03cf9e858cb0dc1911789319bb34a94d45dbb7928e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": 0.450993,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        4
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "577ae0d643d7f9ad1a8df4d43675ee756d28a28fc5a69a51502697d5d466b40d"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_ai_sha256": "5ec57acb1f6f2d8e2ab71b03cf9e858cb0dc1911789319bb34a94d45dbb7928e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        4,
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "A man who rises at such an hour is often met with disdain on land.",
      "output_sha256": "855d0780a23ce2967efcbe0ef651f60817924444e7d645ba5de7b409d7712026",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": 0.392874,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        5
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "fa1a19e452b42351c2ea693fde50ffd00fdc7dc0ec8468f83184faaf168fc999"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_ai_sha256": "855d0780a23ce2967efcbe0ef651f60817924444e7d645ba5de7b409d7712026",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "His family express themselves with superfluous vigor.",
      "output_sha256": "0fa211fce9bb24ea0a62e507131e4d1f8ce3a1b25de7a83bcf6b808ae3adbf04",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_human_sha256": "0fa211fce9bb24ea0a62e507131e4d1f8ce3a1b25de7a83bcf6b808ae3adbf04",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "He must lie still and meditate, or suffer the ignominy of being asked when he is going away again.",
      "output_sha256": "7a74ecece0b36b4306931d607f0d71ecfc6d2ed227c14b5d0e03ddb170404865",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_human_sha256": "7a74ecece0b36b4306931d607f0d71ecfc6d2ed227c14b5d0e03ddb170404865",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "However, this morning, in these ancient chambers of a historic inn nestled in London's core, I have resolved to rise and venture out.",
      "output_sha256": "fe43ea0d4952d1d85b6fe74e7f397df8003aa7e305e2325a0aacf513ab298349",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": 0.446631,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        8
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "7b04fbb1050a8d943fa81128bfc7e851bc154584d35b221ab48bf6adf48844ab"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_ai_sha256": "fe43ea0d4952d1d85b6fe74e7f397df8003aa7e305e2325a0aacf513ab298349",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        8
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The reason for this momentous departure from a life of temporary but deliberate indolence is a lady.",
      "output_sha256": "3ab87bce822340d6d30817207a531de9b9661f581e97416f780efc5c0b3de7be",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_human_sha256": "3ab87bce822340d6d30817207a531de9b9661f581e97416f780efc5c0b3de7be",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "\"Cherchez la femme,\" as the French say with their characteristic logic.",
      "output_sha256": "d973534fa4777898d8ee66319f68d5676d4d75e3ee955f516e7b73f148a87b11",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": 0.609953,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        10
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "3f62f0538a9c03502805d7d92eee674c7f0642fa85f5da57f018106073f3f0f9"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_ai_sha256": "d973534fa4777898d8ee66319f68d5676d4d75e3ee955f516e7b73f148a87b11",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        10
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Well, she is not far to seek, being on the outside of my heavy oak door, tapping, as already hinted, with a sharp insistent delicacy.",
      "output_sha256": "487673179917ef4e26129c71fcd11f019aacaf716ef43269ac1c3b87275f11b8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_human_sha256": "487673179917ef4e26129c71fcd11f019aacaf716ef43269ac1c3b87275f11b8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "To this romantic summons I reply with an articulate growl of acquiescence, and proceed to get ready.",
      "output_sha256": "f4a44fd07eac69e699523b41b54645504c77e34c31db1965b72f40506b741036",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_human_sha256": "f4a44fd07eac69e699523b41b54645504c77e34c31db1965b72f40506b741036",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "To relieve the anxiety of any reader who imagines an impending elopement it may be stated in succinct truthfulness that we are bound on no such desperate venture.",
      "output_sha256": "cf9fa802a01401c3a97de1d98fc77329758aaff48a2d4573c841241627e232a7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_human_sha256": "cf9fa802a01401c3a97de1d98fc77329758aaff48a2d4573c841241627e232a7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "We are going round the corner a few blocks up the Strand, to Covent Garden Market, to see the arrival of the metropolitan supply of produce.",
      "output_sha256": "b2412a1f6c677973591e93606a7703f8783c6f46fb62a93bc7a7892b03540fbe",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_human_sha256": "b2412a1f6c677973591e93606a7703f8783c6f46fb62a93bc7a7892b03540fbe",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Having accomplished a hasty toilet, almost as primitive as that favored by gentlemen aroused to go on watch, and placating an occasional repetition of the tapping by brief protests and reports of progress, I take hat and cane, and drawing the huge antique bolts of my door, discover a young woman standing by the window looking out upon the quadrangle of the old Inn.",
      "output_sha256": "5c869b40a0c005e7a6836222fbfaab8739271930a6b9906f6364219fa0946b45",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_human_sha256": "5c869b40a0c005e7a6836222fbfaab8739271930a6b9906f6364219fa0946b45",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "She is quite the assertive young lady, always devising what she calls \"stunts\" for her articles.",
      "output_sha256": "0871cc3ed2f94e19ce2fdbb7c15b4643b2bbb40b4c4ee2c15b266b80b8814fe6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": 0.509535,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        16
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "4f0a0127cf63931434c20de9b8636d040e5b1cde2489ffed18048a7494544a1b"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_ai_sha256": "0871cc3ed2f94e19ce2fdbb7c15b4643b2bbb40b4c4ee2c15b266b80b8814fe6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        17
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "That is her profession, or one of her professions—writing articles for the press.",
      "output_sha256": "455439cf23483dd62c05ab25ee3b76fcb97ac001b70b5ba859e2ff88d148ee75",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_human_sha256": "455439cf23483dd62c05ab25ee3b76fcb97ac001b70b5ba859e2ff88d148ee75",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The other profession is selling manuscripts, which constitutes the tender bond between us.",
      "output_sha256": "a0206021fba7213afd71e9ea8cb31846fc1b53619193fcef3743db06f786e3ea",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_human_sha256": "a0206021fba7213afd71e9ea8cb31846fc1b53619193fcef3743db06f786e3ea",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "For the usual agent's commission she is selling one of my manuscripts.",
      "output_sha256": "d373e017f390951f166f5b0b76eb0de27e2411c9abfc778126bfff808b8a0cc1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_human_sha256": "d373e017f390951f166f5b0b76eb0de27e2411c9abfc778126bfff808b8a0cc1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Being an unattached and, as it were, unprotected male, she plans little excursions about London to keep me instructed and entertained.",
      "output_sha256": "b5d64d86c97a06c17f21e5dc56276818a52f0b85569fb27fa616769739c22180",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_human_sha256": "b5d64d86c97a06c17f21e5dc56276818a52f0b85569fb27fa616769739c22180",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Here she is attired in the flamboyant finery of a London flowergirl.",
      "output_sha256": "932a264a11436436311a37c29c21d82febeddffa48be8bbad4c6b1fb6f0fa099",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_human_sha256": "932a264a11436436311a37c29c21d82febeddffa48be8bbad4c6b1fb6f0fa099",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "She is about to get the necessary copy for a special article in a morning paper.",
      "output_sha256": "a9e2548574cf9253a44a1e34ead691ce6b9119ac4e74daa2faa2e75c2baecd12",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_human_sha256": "a9e2548574cf9253a44a1e34ead691ce6b9119ac4e74daa2faa2e75c2baecd12",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "With a spark of excitement in her bright black Irish eyes, she appears wholly focused on her task.",
      "output_sha256": "fa8eca61e55dfd26f51f4099586f16da8155cef1e11f2d29bd2e714094d13a06",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": 0.525,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        23
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "3a5afa813d91e2c83854f23902a06fb28f4e4ec4b6f1d9a148c9fa09d9f62439"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_ai_sha256": "fa8eca61e55dfd26f51f4099586f16da8155cef1e11f2d29bd2e714094d13a06",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        23
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Commenting on the beauty of an early summer morning in town, we descend, and passing out under the ponderous ancient archway, we make our leisurely progress westward down the Strand.",
      "output_sha256": "06f093ed55ea617cbf388175402ec605847819bf1f336dc213f86ddc037126f6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_human_sha256": "06f093ed55ea617cbf388175402ec605847819bf1f336dc213f86ddc037126f6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "To those who appreciate and understand the unique charm of London, the city always possesses a beauty all its own; however, at five o'clock on a summer morning, it exudes a youthful fragrance and fresh vitality that touches the soul.",
      "output_sha256": "683f5b45a416a88e2ff8c18c22c3c8ed309e586374192e4b0fb6616d12d0754e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": 0.453681,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        25
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "6e7daaefa73ff93da5127734e59b40ebb6e1d06af5f88a198a61ca803be84d27"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_ai_sha256": "683f5b45a416a88e2ff8c18c22c3c8ed309e586374192e4b0fb6616d12d0754e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        25
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "The newly washed streets gleam in the sunlight, resembling a path of \"patines of bright gold.\"",
      "output_sha256": "d104fe8dd4793efd0d3dca114c6121f86c111e7e52142d72d88ad6930c43d7b5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": 0.610268,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        26
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "65b8a67fbf2a6aebda5f56406ff5dd55d9981f4dc548c8755904903002dd7c5a"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_ai_sha256": "d104fe8dd4793efd0d3dca114c6121f86c111e7e52142d72d88ad6930c43d7b5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        26
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Early buses rumble by, having returned from their overnight stays.",
      "output_sha256": "9265a15d4e3a020388aa00e027b0ee48a6d2c92a91ec4ef60e27a6d459c13fb6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": 0.474498,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        27
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "5d7a5d4a99abb8789c5a97e73fc84bc0fb91e1598f320ea1ec301c5ac14ddba4"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_ai_sha256": "9265a15d4e3a020388aa00e027b0ee48a6d2c92a91ec4ef60e27a6d459c13fb6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        27
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "And, as we near the new Gaiety Theatre, thrusting forward into the great rivers of traffic soon to pour round its base like some bold Byzantine promontory, we see Waterloo Bridge thronged with wagons, piled high.",
      "output_sha256": "aa5527b044431632eaa7bfe2edf9e69b94c47c46348fb53e7a720a505cdc1617",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_human_sha256": "aa5527b044431632eaa7bfe2edf9e69b94c47c46348fb53e7a720a505cdc1617",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "From all quarters they are coming, past Charing Cross the great wains are arriving from Paddington Terminal, from the market-garden section of Middlesex and Surrey.",
      "output_sha256": "71ae29f1cb1b05939eddcb3335dd0ec0b3de130327d1ff2cfb0d399ca8715a4f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_human_sha256": "71ae29f1cb1b05939eddcb3335dd0ec0b3de130327d1ff2cfb0d399ca8715a4f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Down Wellington Street, carts filled with vegetables from Brentwood and Coggeshall roll by, alongside neat vans packed with crates of watercress harvested from the lush lowlands of Suffolk and Cambridgeshire.",
      "output_sha256": "f1e077f31d8385136e2eb11d72ea6f00573d3979b6b718de4830039ab837eb66",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": 0.856295,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        30
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "5a7b4cb13d4c7bb58aa168ffd250c3b66cd5fb5997fd74b2bba4bf418e211c37"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f1e077f31d8385136e2eb11d72ea6f00573d3979b6b718de4830039ab837eb66",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        30,
        31
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Behind us thunder large four-horse vehicles from the docks, carrying peaches from South Africa, potatoes from the Canary Islands, onions from France, apples from California, oranges from the West Indies, pineapples from Central America, grapes from Spain, and bananas from Colombia.",
      "output_sha256": "48ad36e5c7b50b732a640de48d9890f31e8bd534d8d30f4b0df73f76fc1ca9a1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": 0.856295,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        30
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "5a7b4cb13d4c7bb58aa168ffd250c3b66cd5fb5997fd74b2bba4bf418e211c37"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_ai_sha256": "48ad36e5c7b50b732a640de48d9890f31e8bd534d8d30f4b0df73f76fc1ca9a1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        30,
        31
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "We turn in under an archway behind a theatre and adjacent to the stage-door of the Opera House.",
      "output_sha256": "c6c3efd6ad3173b10b38958efdb204167d2d073181626d8897378d2166717832",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_human_sha256": "c6c3efd6ad3173b10b38958efdb204167d2d073181626d8897378d2166717832",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The booths are rapidly filling with produce.",
      "output_sha256": "ad4532a68061c6bc812c0ec1ba8449e5513b40a3abd3bc339de7a9465bfcb342",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 32,
      "source_human_sha256": "ad4532a68061c6bc812c0ec1ba8449e5513b40a3abd3bc339de7a9465bfcb342",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Gentlemen in long alpaca coats and carrying formidable marbled note-books walk about with an important air.",
      "output_sha256": "f9c9f819d85d3fe1414d17eea497c5ccc7b4816bf32ecdca241fa71b08468cbd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_human_sha256": "f9c9f819d85d3fe1414d17eea497c5ccc7b4816bf32ecdca241fa71b08468cbd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "A mountain range of pumpkins rises behind a hill of cabbages.",
      "output_sha256": "f0560a9d144b9ea676ad4c15ca040f84762b5d7cc7fbf4b674f90445230eecfc",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_human_sha256": "f0560a9d144b9ea676ad4c15ca040f84762b5d7cc7fbf4b674f90445230eecfc",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Festoons of onions are being suspended from rails.",
      "output_sha256": "9650a0760e99040470e3aa029fe2e150b1096ff71a6aba7a3defe10ea142243a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_human_sha256": "9650a0760e99040470e3aa029fe2e150b1096ff71a6aba7a3defe10ea142243a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 38,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The heads of barrels are being knocked in, disclosing purple grapes buried in corkdust.",
      "output_sha256": "bc6e6ce81f6afedf0c9f4a7f59977a0b996e3578f035dc3ea777ad7575880f90",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_human_sha256": "bc6e6ce81f6afedf0c9f4a7f59977a0b996e3578f035dc3ea777ad7575880f90",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 39,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Pears and figs, grown under glass for wealthy patrons, repose in soft tissue-lined boxes.",
      "output_sha256": "0262d8a7cdccda3a325a78086235ece06f7cd586f7fb19c79b9686fdd3738709",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_human_sha256": "0262d8a7cdccda3a325a78086235ece06f7cd586f7fb19c79b9686fdd3738709",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 40,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "A broken crate of tangerine oranges spills its vibrant contents, creating a splash of ruddy gold on the wooden walkway.",
      "output_sha256": "52c9cb354e482258591fc9a86bd49d2e39287152bda0df76bb5acd05e879799e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": 0.7125,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        38
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f5a5a8e2225c26aacc932cdb805e2a4e75717b4e86127ccbf28213acafba45fd"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_ai_sha256": "52c9cb354e482258591fc9a86bd49d2e39287152bda0df76bb5acd05e879799e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        38
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 41,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "A wagon is driven in, a heavy load of beets, and the broad wheels crush through the soft fruit so that the air is heavy with the acrid sweetness.",
      "output_sha256": "07a4b396e8351035538b70bd47c798236196aa3a41b97558593549c4f7b5c371",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_human_sha256": "07a4b396e8351035538b70bd47c798236196aa3a41b97558593549c4f7b5c371",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 42,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "We pick our way among the booths and stalls until we find the flowers.",
      "output_sha256": "30dcd50ce4988b19b53bb2cdb72c637a89cb7c6992255ece26bb9f38c98cc0e9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 37,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_human_sha256": "30dcd50ce4988b19b53bb2cdb72c637a89cb7c6992255ece26bb9f38c98cc0e9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 43,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Here is a crowd of ladies, young, so-so and some quite matronly, and all dressed in this same flamboyant finery of which I have spoken.",
      "output_sha256": "c18f84a6d90259885363c0a165a9701b4d8115b2e7af29d93c7f9dce58a579c9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 38,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 41,
      "source_human_sha256": "c18f84a6d90259885363c0a165a9701b4d8115b2e7af29d93c7f9dce58a579c9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 44,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "They are grouped about an almost overpowering mass of blooms.",
      "output_sha256": "f14ab126bf83a04f523564d7d97ea4486ed9e774654f1c26befb15c90475f27d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 38,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_human_sha256": "f14ab126bf83a04f523564d7d97ea4486ed9e774654f1c26befb15c90475f27d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 45,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Roses just now predominate.",
      "output_sha256": "819306a4ea3e7d9f514a87296bfcf79c96c5e111da808bd123179f1dc39b4aae",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 43,
      "source_human_sha256": "819306a4ea3e7d9f514a87296bfcf79c96c5e111da808bd123179f1dc39b4aae",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 46,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "There is a satisfying solidity about the bunches, a glorious abundance which, in a commodity so easily enjoyed without ownership, is scarcely credible.",
      "output_sha256": "dbf1375fedc2a540f577c307d18274dc8243eaa68c088af532e6eed258402b5d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 44,
      "source_human_sha256": "dbf1375fedc2a540f577c307d18274dc8243eaa68c088af532e6eed258402b5d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 47,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I feel no desire to own these huge aggregations of odorous beauty.",
      "output_sha256": "8f23d3d42b70be1bc013334397b26b9ed02ac6574f52fef25347527b17280c4a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 40,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 45,
      "source_human_sha256": "8f23d3d42b70be1bc013334397b26b9ed02ac6574f52fef25347527b17280c4a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 48,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It would be like owning a harem, one imagines.",
      "output_sha256": "9d2acce965a7efdca4d03449043688964ad34e549afaf84fa1b4181ab9d6efce",
      "alignment_unit_index": 40,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 46,
      "source_human_sha256": "9d2acce965a7efdca4d03449043688964ad34e549afaf84fa1b4181ab9d6efce",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 49,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Vivid patches of blue violets in round baskets and delicate eglantine in dainty boxes provide a striking contrast to the grand display of roses and the dew-kissed maiden-hair ferns nearby.",
      "output_sha256": "88aab763ea6bb37e410910436bbbf35d93ef6a847d649487bf3e533a68c00f9d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 41,
      "alignment_score": 0.591878,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        47
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "5100435e76693cb0974d37209410169cf2e0c6c627817e04d2344b5281633046"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 44,
      "source_ai_sha256": "88aab763ea6bb37e410910436bbbf35d93ef6a847d649487bf3e533a68c00f9d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        44
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 50,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "\"And what are those things at all?\" demands my companion, diverted for a moment from the flowers.",
      "output_sha256": "6cf357ccbb4f9cc11c98f3741a4ed78631bdf3f8e0c34b02e587691490cfeed1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 42,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 48,
      "source_human_sha256": "6cf357ccbb4f9cc11c98f3741a4ed78631bdf3f8e0c34b02e587691490cfeed1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 51,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "She nods towards a mass of dull-green affairs piled on mats or being lifted from big vans.",
      "output_sha256": "8c5bb53fb3bdf9f778b845ed44894d9b6ac90c696230d3eecc8c0f21403d21ea",
      "alignment_unit_index": 43,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 49,
      "source_human_sha256": "8c5bb53fb3bdf9f778b845ed44894d9b6ac90c696230d3eecc8c0f21403d21ea",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 52,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "She is a Cockney and displays surprise when she is told those things are bananas.",
      "output_sha256": "5484d25b952dc5575f143a2f996bff8a8121293d28620355a84b93f05b0d6023",
      "alignment_unit_index": 44,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 50,
      "source_human_sha256": "5484d25b952dc5575f143a2f996bff8a8121293d28620355a84b93f05b0d6023",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 53,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "She shrugs and turns again to the musk-roses, and forgets.",
      "output_sha256": "3e1f470a155aeedc07a7c503856061c5f4bcd90eba8aae15c6558842f5bca4c7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 45,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 51,
      "source_human_sha256": "3e1f470a155aeedc07a7c503856061c5f4bcd90eba8aae15c6558842f5bca4c7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 54,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "For me, however, the sharp, penetrating scent of the green fruit cuts through the heavy perfume of the flowers and evokes vivid memories.",
      "output_sha256": "5e831c727d5bd2ebaabcafda94efee9d6c2587df4a8e968b3d67b6a94b767203",
      "alignment_unit_index": 46,
      "alignment_score": 0.649697,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        52
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d2f7c07a91138e62b0ec2a76db80be3b222950bad4bd1c4f25293bff5afe6201"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 49,
      "source_ai_sha256": "5e831c727d5bd2ebaabcafda94efee9d6c2587df4a8e968b3d67b6a94b767203",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        49,
        50
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 55,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "I envision farms in distant Colombia or possibly Costa Rica.",
      "output_sha256": "6b0a19c8fb582efbbff45eb58015d622f6a2568aa8162bd91b7181b54c13c917",
      "alignment_unit_index": 46,
      "alignment_score": 0.649697,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        52
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d2f7c07a91138e62b0ec2a76db80be3b222950bad4bd1c4f25293bff5afe6201"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 50,
      "source_ai_sha256": "6b0a19c8fb582efbbff45eb58015d622f6a2568aa8162bd91b7181b54c13c917",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        49,
        50
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 56,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "There's nothing quite like a smell to awaken the past.",
      "output_sha256": "9a815ff73035f72093702774692f068efb1520353dec89096197f16818fd5edf",
      "alignment_unit_index": 47,
      "alignment_score": 0.382105,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        53
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "546edc9618c61a08ef67e1cfcfa4da4a8eb82f953a125a56997a789ca8f7cf60"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 51,
      "source_ai_sha256": "9a815ff73035f72093702774692f068efb1520353dec89096197f16818fd5edf",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        51
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 57,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I see the timber pier and the long line of rackety open-slatted cars jangling into the dark shed, pushed by a noisy, squealing locomotive.",
      "output_sha256": "ee36af97529956b0f86d24d1710ca40a2777e0a253dbff4589fab44d784aa858",
      "alignment_unit_index": 48,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 54,
      "source_human_sha256": "ee36af97529956b0f86d24d1710ca40a2777e0a253dbff4589fab44d784aa858",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 58,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "I see boys napping between shifts, their large straw hats shielding their faces as they sprawl on the ground.",
      "output_sha256": "a5bbb582900bf9032f46ba0be6fc590d13494093d5b92079ec1be0c51b5ca4b5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 49,
      "alignment_score": 0.68069,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        55
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d47611810a296a634be22148cf9c187f2af2636eb09446ebaeb16eb445f10177"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 53,
      "source_ai_sha256": "a5bbb582900bf9032f46ba0be6fc590d13494093d5b92079ec1be0c51b5ca4b5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        53
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 59,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "In the distance rise the blue mountains; behind is the motionless blue sea.",
      "output_sha256": "836a83f0dd66e9d0c770f17866a7c96c33bb0f9700ac1e9c51a0e3775d9be72b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 50,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 56,
      "source_human_sha256": "836a83f0dd66e9d0c770f17866a7c96c33bb0f9700ac1e9c51a0e3775d9be72b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 60,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I hear the whine of the elevators, the monotonous click of the counters, the harsh cries of irresponsible and argumentative natives.",
      "output_sha256": "f1cab964ed2d7fe403a376846957afc3e593532490d41bb4f29830eb1de6310d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 51,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 57,
      "source_human_sha256": "f1cab964ed2d7fe403a376846957afc3e593532490d41bb4f29830eb1de6310d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 61,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "I can feel the heat of the tropical day and see the glimmer of white waves crashing upon yellow sands beneath tall palms.",
      "output_sha256": "2ae410d727b806294843ca47edcdc86fa032f253a497b8a176e13d15ec84a76a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 52,
      "alignment_score": 0.707609,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        58
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "cdf1663793c4300e531bc1f2f77ef6ed9697615150329ef4b160f3aa642cea7f"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 56,
      "source_ai_sha256": "2ae410d727b806294843ca47edcdc86fa032f253a497b8a176e13d15ec84a76a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        56
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 62,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I recall the mysterious impenetrable solitude of the jungle, a solitude alive, if one is equipped with knowledge, with a ceaseless warfare of winged and crawling hosts.",
      "output_sha256": "7d600410a078262674b1929f5bfdc4af068fb88b73934bd0a473fa10c76fc158",
      "alignment_unit_index": 53,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 59,
      "source_human_sha256": "7d600410a078262674b1929f5bfdc4af068fb88b73934bd0a473fa10c76fc158",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 63,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "While my companion diligently collects material for her article about the Market, I deftly step aside to avoid a swarthy gentleman from Calabria, who, with his two-wheeled barrow, serves as the final link in the vast transportation chain connecting the remote farmer in tropical lands to the Cockney pedestrian pausing on the sidewalk to purchase a banana for a few pence.",
      "output_sha256": "9ed4babd628a729b917fd4b3ff2eb8911231bc0beb863f2248b89fac7a036414",
      "alignment_unit_index": 54,
      "alignment_score": 0.577609,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        60
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f910f7d642a37d5340592eede0992455f9408f82c1410f78dec5c72d52cf5bc4"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 58,
      "source_ai_sha256": "9ed4babd628a729b917fd4b3ff2eb8911231bc0beb863f2248b89fac7a036414",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        58
      ]
    }
  ]
}
